<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>This method will significantly decrease the recoil of your secondary submachine gun, leaving only a slight sideways recoil.
For optimal results, it is recommended to use a screen resolution of 1920x1080 (although lower resolutions may also work).
Set your in-game control sensitivity to 10 and your mouse DPI to 600.
If, by chance, you experience a problem where pressing the shooting button in-game doesn't fire the gun and instead activates the macro, simply download the app drivers.
Resoulution 1920x1080</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
Delay 8 ms
Delay 16 ms
MoveR 0 14
Delay 8 ms
Delay 16 ms
MoveR 0 15
Delay 8 ms
Delay 16 ms
MoveR 0 15
Delay 8 ms
Delay 16 ms
MoveR 0 15
Delay 8 ms
Delay 16 ms
MoveR 0 15
Delay 8 ms
Delay 16 ms
MoveR 0 15
Delay 8 ms
Delay 16 ms
MoveR 0 15
Delay 16 ms
LeftUp 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Tom Clancy's Rainbow Six Siege</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>